extends layout
//- Service assignments of the global account. Needs page, view (ServiceAssignmentsDto).
block actions
  - import neko.platform.presentation.web.icons : icon;
  .btn-list
    a.btn(href="/landscape")
      | !{icon("hexagons")}
      | Landscape
    a.btn(href="/landscape/recovery")
      | !{icon("arrows-exchange")}
      | Disaster recovery
block content
  p.text-secondary Which services each subaccount may use: the role collections of a subaccount can only grant rights of its assigned services, and files can only be uploaded to subaccounts with the service “files”. A subaccount with every service also gets services added later. A service stays assigned while a role collection of the subaccount grants its rights. Below each service: the subaccount's entitlements to its plans.
  include assignments_table
